## Post-hoc diagnostic

Keeping P12's exact frozen dispatch decisions and measured compiler medians, but hypothetically replacing P12 source-build time with ordinary direct source-build time, gives **0.963002x direct case-balanced** and **0.878897x workload-weighted**. This is diagnostic only, not a measured implementation endpoint.

## Predeclared outcomes

- Gate-P direct-crossover PASS: **False**.
- Lazy-statistics engineering success: **False**.

P12 therefore validates the lazy-statistics mechanism as a real implementation improvement over P11, while leaving the stronger case-balanced end-to-end crossover just unresolved.
